        "lingua_originale": "en",
        "titolo_orig": "Hantavirus ship evacuation nears completion as 94 flown home",
        "testo_it": "Completata l'evacuazione della nave da crociera colpita dall'Hantavirus: 94 passeggeri rientrati.",
        "priorita": "Media",
        "id_gruppo": 1,
        "link": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260511-hantavirus-ship-evacuation-nears-completion-as-94-flown-home",
        "orario": "15:09",
        "timestamp": 1778504982,
        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. Hantavirus ship evacuation nears completion as 94 flown home Issued on: 11/05/2026 - 15:09 A complex day-long operation to repatriate occupants of a cruise ship struck by a deadly hantavirus outbreak neared completion late Sunday after 94 people of various nationalities were flown home from Spain's Canary Islands. Three passengers from the MV Hondius -- a Dutch husband and wife and a German woman -- have died, while others have fallen sick with the rare disease, which usually spreads among rodents. No vaccines or specific treatments exist for hantavirus, which is endemic in Argentina, where the ship departed in April. 'I will make order': Macorn calls for silence at Africa summit 11/05/2026 Africa UK's Starmer promises to be bolder to try to rescue his job 11/05/2026 Iran-US ceasefire grows shaky after Trump rejects Tehran's latest proposal 11/05/2026 More confirmed hantavirus cases: The situation in France 11/05/2026 Closing arguments in Sarkozy trial: Ex-French pdt appealing verdict in Libya finance case 11/05/2026 Starmer vows to prove 'doubters' wrong, bring UK closer to the EU to rescue his job 11/05/2026 Trump rejects Iran's response to US peace proposal as 'unacceptable' 11/05/2026 Suspected hantavirus case triggers emergency deployment to isolated island 11/05/2026 Hantavirus outbreak: US, French nationals test positive after evacuating ship 11/05/2026"
